[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:101. A Card From Jimmy]
[00:00.600]Lesson 101 | 第101课
[00:02.725]Read Jimmy's card to me, please, Mary. | 玛丽，请你把吉米的卡片念给我听。
[00:06.880]I have just arrived in Scotland, | 我刚到苏格兰，
[00:10.470]and I'm staying at a youth hostel. | 我正住在一家青年旅社。
[00:13.390]Eh? | 咦？
[00:14.680]He says he's just arrived in Scotland. | 他说他刚到苏格兰。
[00:19.145]He says he's staying at a youth hostel. | 他说他正住在一间青年旅社。
[00:22.800]You know he's a member of the YHA. | 你知道他是青年旅社协会的成员。
[00:26.240]The what? | 什么？
[00:27.410]The YHA, Mother. | 青年旅社协会，妈妈。
[00:30.245]The Youth Hostels Association. | 青年旅社协会。
[00:33.185]What else does he say? | 他还说了些什么？
[00:35.545]I'll write a letter soon. | 我很快就会写信。
[00:38.145]I hope you are all well. | 我希望你们一切都好。
[00:40.280]What? | 什么？
[00:41.265]Speak up, Mary. I'm afraid I can't hear you. | 玛丽，大声点。我恐怕听不见你说话。
[00:46.075]He says he'll write a letter soon. | 他说他很快就会写信。
[00:49.580]He hopes we are all well. | 他希望我们一切都好。
[00:52.385]Love, Jimmy. | 爱你的，吉米。
[00:54.400]Is that all? | 就这些吗？
[00:56.200]He doesn't say very much, does he? | 他没说多少，是吗？
[00:59.555]He can't write very much on a card, Mother. | 妈妈，他不能在一张卡片上写很多东西。